canon = "Ch18 (Keeper, 2026-11-02, book-checked). DAYTIME. The three ride out; Tamlin and Lucien lay the purple blanket a few feet into a glen and Lucien stays on it with the wine. Tamlin: 'I want to show you something' [C], and leads her down the hill to the stream, over brooks and up knolls to a mound above a clearing ringed with tall trees and a sparkling silver pool, warm and full of starlight. 'This was my favorite haunt as a boy' [C] comes before the swim; he dares her to 'Jump in' [C]; she swims in her ivory underthings. Tamlin tells Lucien's history at the pool (youngest of seven brothers, the lover executed); the lucien lines are X wording of that. No knife gift in ch18. X (accepted by the Keeper): she finds the pool before he catches up (the player-led deed); the dare line; the golden-hour line. The blanket is 125 m from the pool (marks are in the starlight_pool anchor's frame; pool = the Starlight Pool landmark)."
